    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43040" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσχᾰρ-όω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσχάρα</span> v) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>form an
				eschar,</i> of ointments, <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				50.8.2
			</span></i>:— 
				Pass.
			, <i>come to an eschar,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠσχαρωμένα ἕλκη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					4.171
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>ulcerate,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ὑστέραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					2.12
				</span></i>
			 : abs., <i>to be caustic,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.75
			</span></i>.</div>
